{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Flicker</strong> is a cooperative horror game for 1\u20134 players. Navigate a fractured reality with no clear form or end. Whatever's keeping you here doesn't speak \u2014 it simply waits. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802260?t=1761030237","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802260/f914358b1db53705396122e938d3fb45d4a87372/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761030237","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802260/e5e53cbb3f271e020205e8ef593f47edc7ec9bc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761030237","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802260/e5e53cbb3f271e020205e8ef593f47edc7ec9bc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761030237","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Flicker</strong> is a cooperative horror game for 1\u20134 players. Navigate a fractured reality with no clear form or end. Whatever's keeping you here doesn't speak \u2014 it simply waits. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>","developers":["Skmaestro"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{